# Mosquitto ACL — Taktflow MQTT topic access control
# All internal services share a single user but ACL limits topic scope.
# Format: https://mosquitto.org/man/mosquitto-conf-5.html

# CAN gateway: publishes decoded CAN telemetry and DTC alerts
user taktflow
topic readwrite taktflow/#
# vehicle/# namespace: ML anomaly alerts (vehicle/alerts), DTC events
# (vehicle/dtc/new), retained telemetry (vehicle/telemetry) — consumed by
# the cloud connector and the SIL/HIL verdict checkers.
topic readwrite vehicle/#
